    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788380/extras/bf6554e59a89bf1bb69b140b3c683c21.poster.avif?t=1732693792\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788380/extras/bf6554e59a89bf1bb69b140b3c683c21.webm?t=1732693792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>It's a puzzle game, an action game, and a dark humour game that mixes a lot of gameplay. The game focuses on a housewife who is oppressed by life, since she married a husband who can't make money, her life is incredibly bad, so she can make the choice to kill him, however, disposing of the body is a hassle, and she always reveals herself, bringing a lot of unnecessary trouble. All the code and resources of this game are open source, if you need them, you can find them in the root directory of the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788380/extras/d7c07f2c24231b89d59904b6d2f8bb04.poster.avif?t=1732693792\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788380/extras/d7c07f2c24231b89d59904b6d2f8bb04.webm?t=1732693792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788380/extras/d7c07f2c24231b89d59904b6d2f8bb04.mp4?t=1732693792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788380/extras/bb38cec48a1e87a82ea8892a8fc3ac33.poster.avif?t=1732693792\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788380/extras/bb3